# REST Client (VS Code: humao.rest-client). Start the app first: npm run dev
# Exercise B: the API rejects questions longer than 2,000 characters (after trimming) with 400.
# REST Client cannot embed a file inside a JSON string, so the long question is inlined below
# (2079 characters). For a realistic one, paste fixtures/attacks/oversize.txt into the UI.

@api = http://localhost:3000

### Login as alice (analyst, acme)
# @name alice
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@acme" }

### Oversize question (expected: 400 { error: "invalid_request", issues: ["question"] })
POST {{api}}/api/assistant
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}

